  "plain": "The famous Tic Tac video, filmed in 2004 by Navy jets from the aircraft carrier USS Nimitz and showing a white oval object shaped like the mint, may show a camera zoom change rather than the object itself doing something strange. The skeptic Michael Shermer relays this from Mick West, another skeptic who studies UFO videos, who points out that the screen reads \"zoom 1.0\" on its vertical axis. If West is right, part of what looks odd in the footage would come from the camera, not the object."
